WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
What should I do?

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,080
Aren’t we going to look for it?

3
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,880
We just need to listen to Brother Lin.

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,440
Even if there is no Yuyanjia

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:09,140
He can also take us out of here.

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,430
He is just an ordinary person

7
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,110
A little surprising at most

8
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:15,110
Come out, the real Yu Yanjia

9
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,510
I guarantee that he will not die

10
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:17,670
I do what I say

11
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:21,190
Whoever touches Yu Yanjia will step on me first.

12
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,030
As long as the key person comes out

13
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,510
We keep him safe

14
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:26,510
So many of us are still afraid

15
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,030
Who dares to come

16
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,430
Let's deal with him

17
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:32,870
I am a royal speaker

18
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,100
You are a royal speaker

19
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,820
My name is Liu Yunwei

20
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,260
I am a royal speaker

21
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,220
Yuyanjia is here

22
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,740
Let's go with Yu Yanren, Brother Wei

23
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,820
Please bring your little brother with you

24
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,340
Brother Wei, why didn’t you tell me earlier?
